		<description><![CDATA[<p>Pretty model Max Schneider tells everything on the scandal with Madonna after shooting on the street for a Dolce &#38; [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/max-schneider-tells-everything-on-the-scandal-with-madonna/20140723">Max Schneider tells everything on the scandal with Madonna: &#8216;She is brilliant, it was brilliant&#8217;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Pretty model <strong>Max Schneider tells everything on the scandal with Madonna</strong> after shooting on the street for a <strong>Dolce &amp; Gabbana</strong> campaign. <strong>Max</strong> realized how &#8220;brilliant <strong>Madonna</strong> is&#8221; and &#8220;why she is what she is.&#8221;</p>
<p>Media went crazy when paparazzi shoot <strong>Madonna</strong> with this very young guy. Max tells <a title="AndPop" href="http://www.andpop.com/2014/07/23/max-schneider-talks-meeting-girlfriend-gay-club/" target="_blank">AndPop</a> that it was not planned, but it was brilliant because <strong>Madonna</strong> knew that paparazzi were going to be there and people were going to talk about it. &#8220;And I was 17 and it was such a brilliant scandal idea,&#8221; adds <strong>Max Schneider</strong>. &#8220;A few days later I realized &#8216;Wow it was not intentional, what a brilliant media move!'&#8221;</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Essentially we were doing this <strong>Dolce &amp; Gabbana</strong> campaign and this last shoot wasn&#8217;t planned. <strong>Madonna</strong> was like &#8216;I wanna do a shoot on the street right now!&#8217; And <strong>Dolce and Gabbana</strong> said &#8216;Let&#8217;s go&#8230; let&#8217;s do it!&#8217; She knew exactly what she was doing.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Max Schneider</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
